  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mustam&#xe4;e Hosp.Master Plan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Mustam&#xe4;e Hospital Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att utveckla en master plan f&#xf6;r Mustam&#xe4;esjukhuset i Tallinn enligt modern standard. Projektet inkluderar &#xe4;ven utbildning av medicinsk och administrativ personal. Planen ska anv&#xe4;ndas som modell f&#xf6;r utvecklandet av andra estniska sjukhus.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to develop a master plan for the re-development of Mustam&#xe4;e Hospital in Tallinn according to modern standards and requirements. The project also includes training of key-medical and administartive personnel. The master plan will be used to establish a guiding model for other Estonian hospitals.</narrative>
  </description>
